# Multi-request file: open it in the http.me panel (Open With… > http.me) to get one tab per request,
# a Send All button, and one response tab per request. Select an Environment (demo-dev / demo-prod) first.

### List posts
GET {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts?_limit=3
Accept: application/json

### Get one post
GET {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts/1
Accept: application/json

### Create post
POST {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello from http.me",
  "body": "Created by the multi-request demo",
  "userId": 1
}

### Update post
PUT {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated title",
  "body": "Updated body",
  "userId": 1
}

### Patch title
PATCH {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Only the title changes"
}

### Delete post
DELETE {{JSONPLACEHOLDER_URL}}/posts/1
